{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: 工程实践MOC | 面试总览","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Agent 并发处理和流量控制如何设计？\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"工程实践\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/工程实践\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">工程实践MOC</a> | <a data-href=\"面试总览\" href=\"面试总览\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">面试总览</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"Agent 并发处理和流量控制如何设计？\" dir=\"auto\">Agent 并发处理和流量控制如何设计？</h1>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Agent 系统如何应对突发流量？如何设计并发处理和流量控制机制？</p>\n<h4 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>一、多层流量控制</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">TrafficController</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"流量控制器\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 第一层：全局 QPS 限流</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>global_rate_limiter <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> TokenBucketRateLimiter<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n            capacity<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">1000</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>    <span class=\"token comment\"># 令牌桶容量</span>\n            refill_rate<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">500</span>   <span class=\"token comment\"># 每秒填充 500 个</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 第二层：用户级别限流</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>user_rate_limiter <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> SlidingWindowRateLimiter<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n            window_size<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">60</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>   <span class=\"token comment\"># 60 秒窗口</span>\n            max_requests<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">30</span>   <span class=\"token comment\"># 每用户每分钟 30 次</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 第三层：模型级别并发控制</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>model_semaphore <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> asyncio<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>Semaphore<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">50</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 最多 50 个并发 LLM 调用</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">acquire</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> user_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">bool</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 1. 检查全局限流</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">not</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>global_rate_limiter<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>acquire<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">raise</span> RateLimitExceeded<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"系统繁忙，请稍后重试\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 2. 检查用户限流</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">not</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>user_rate_limiter<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>acquire<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>user_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">raise</span> RateLimitExceeded<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"请求过于频繁，请稍后再试\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 3. 获取模型并发许可</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>model_semaphore<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>acquire<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>二、背压机制（Backpressure）</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">BackpressureHandler</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"背压处理\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> kafka_consumer<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>consumer <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> kafka_consumer\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>lag_threshold <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">1000</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 消息积压阈值</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">process_with_backpressure</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"根据积压情况动态调整消费速度\"\"\"</span>\n        lag <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>consumer<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get_lag<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> lag <span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>lag_threshold <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> <span class=\"token number\">2</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 严重积压：拒绝新请求，只处理已有消息</span>\n            self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>consumer<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>pause<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_scale_up_consumers<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">elif</span> lag <span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>lag_threshold<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 轻度积压：增加消费者</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_scale_up_consumers<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">else</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 正常：恢复消费</span>\n            self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>consumer<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>resume<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_scale_up_consumers</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"动态扩容消费者\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># K8s HPA 自动扩容 Pod</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 或增加协程数量</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">pass</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>三、死信队列与重试</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">DeadLetterQueue</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"死信队列处理\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">process_message</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> message<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Message<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">try</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>handle<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>message<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> result\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">except</span> RetryableError <span class=\"token keyword\">as</span> e<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 可重试错误：重新入队，带重试计数</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> message<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>retry_count <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                message<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>retry_count <span class=\"token operator\">+=</span> <span class=\"token number\">1</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>retry_queue<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>enqueue<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>message<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> delay<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">2</span> <span class=\"token operator\">**</span> message<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>retry_count<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">else</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>dlq<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>enqueue<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>message<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> reason<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"超过最大重试次数\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">except</span> NonRetryableError <span class=\"token keyword\">as</span> e<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 不可重试错误：直接进入死信队列</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>dlq<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>enqueue<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>message<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> reason<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>e<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>四、消息幂等设计</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">IdempotentProcessor</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"幂等处理器\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">process</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> message<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Message<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> Result<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 1. 检查是否已处理（Redis SET NX）</span>\n        message_key <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"processed:</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>message<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">id</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span>\n        is_new <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>redis<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">set</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>message_key<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"1\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> nx<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token boolean\">True</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> ex<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">86400</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">not</span> is_new<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 已处理，返回缓存结果</span>\n            cached <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>redis<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"result:</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>message<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">id</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> Result<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>from_json<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>cached<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 2. 处理消息</span>\n        result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>handle<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>message<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 3. 缓存结果</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>redis<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">set</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"result:</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>message<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">id</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> result<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>to_json<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> ex<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">86400</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> result\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h4 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>\"如何处理消息乱序？\"</strong> — 按 session_id hash 分区，保证同一会话消息有序</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>\"如何防止 Rate Limit 雪崩？\"</strong> — Decorrelated Jitter 退避，比指数退避更快恢复</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关知识点\" dir=\"auto\">相关知识点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">工程实践MOC</a></li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}